  "id": "exercise-addiction",
  "term": "exercise addiction",
  "definition": "Exercise addiction is an addictive pattern of excessive physical activity in which a person keeps exercising without adequate breaks, even when injured. It can involve persistent preoccupation with exercise and withdrawal-like symptoms when not exercising; some descriptions distinguish a primary form driven by compulsive exercise and a secondary form linked with eating disorders.",
